menu "OBD2 Firmware Configuration"

    config OBD2_VIRTUAL_BENCH
        bool "Enable LilyGO TTGO T-Display S3 Virtual Bench mode"
        default n
        help
            Configures the firmware for black-box bench testing on a LilyGO
            TTGO T-Display S3 board (ESP32-S3 + 170x320 ST7789 TFT).
            Disables physical CAN/K-Line/ADC/LED GPIO initialization that
            conflicts with the TFT parallel bus, simulates V_BAT (default
            12.6 V), and enables the live ST7789 status display.

endmenu
